# Team Agent task workflow

When the task comes from Kroogy Team Agent:

- Start from an up-to-date main and a separate feature branch. Do not commit on main.
- Link the task and the branch in the local report: `npx tsx scripts/team-agent-local-report.ts`.
- Report paths and SHAs only. Do not send file contents, diffs, or anything from `.env` or `.env.local`.
- After a commit, report the new SHA. After a push, say that the branch is on GitHub.
- Do not force-push. Do not merge into main. Do not deploy production.
- Open a pull request only when the task workflow says to.
- A local commit, a push, and a Preview deploy are different facts. Say which one happened.
